  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MM エグザビークルシリーズに「ブーストブレイブバイクVer.」が登場！新規造形のジョイントパーツと、特徴的な外装パーツで構成された豪華仕様！",
      "en": "\"Boost Brave Bike Ver.\" is now available in the 30MM Exa Vehicle Series! Luxurious specification consisting of newly shaped joint parts and distinctive exterior parts!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 新規造形のブロック型ジョイントパーツを採用。",
      "en": "• Adopts newly shaped block type joint parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ブロック型ジョイントパーツを起点に、様々なカスタマイズが可能。",
      "en": "• Various customizations are possible starting with block-type joint parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 多層構造になっており重厚感・緻密なディテールを再現。",
      "en": "• It has a multi-layered structure that reproduces a profound feeling and detailed details."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りの既存機体の搭乗が可能。",
      "en": "• Existing aircraft (sold separately) can be boarded."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 大型ホイールが2輪付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with 2 large wheels."
    }
  ],
